# Numeric golden set, hand-labelled against Caterpillar's FY2025 10-K.
#
# Every `value` was read out of the filing, and wherever the MD&A restates a
# statement figure in prose the two were checked against each other -- the
# income statement's "67,589" against "Total sales and revenues for 2025 were
# $67.589 billion". None of these came from running the parser. Grading a
# parser against its own output scores 1.000 and means nothing.
#
# Declining splits in two here, and the distinction is the point:
#
#   reason "not-stated"    -- the filing does not contain the figure. Declining
#                             is correct and complete.
#   reason "not-extracted" -- the filing states it, in a table the parser
#                             declined to read. Declining is still the correct
#                             *behaviour* (the alternative is answering from
#                             the wrong table) but it is a coverage failure,
#                             and `coverage_gap` reports it separately so the
#                             18.7% extraction rate cannot hide inside a
#                             healthy refusal_recall.
#
# Collapsing those two into one label would make the parser's blindness look
# like good judgement, and would reward shrinking the extraction rate further.

